  "title": "Orbic 400L - No Default Route Detected error message",
  "body": "I bought the Orbic 400L from ebay (and installed rayhunter myself) and it seems to have come with an outdated sim card.  I tried test mode and I got only 1 cell tower connection.  I then took a sprint sim card from an old iphone and i got 187 towers using that, but the warning still shows.  I'm wondering what is wrong with the initial sim card and if the other sim card im using is functioning properly.  I looked through the read me and the forum but i couldnt find anything on this so apologies if this is covered somewhere.  Any insight on this would be greatly appreciated, I have 4 of these that I'm trying to get up and running for various friends who may be likely to encounter stingrays.  I've attached a screenshot of what I'm seeing for reference.\r\n\r\nEdited to clarify i installed rayhunter from the latest release on github - not a preinstalled device from ebay\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3839\" height=\"2159\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-06 131255\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c98d2e2c-ce31-4ed5-9425-cf92ff606445\" />\r\n",
