      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A7-h4",
      "body": "the latest version of rayhunter has removed that warning again due to too many false positives. please don't buy the preinstalled devices from ebay (they are severely overpriced) and instead familiarize yourself with how to install rayhunter yourself so you're able to receive updates",
