          "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A7-jc",
          "body": "its possible im misunderstanding the test heuristic.  The way im understanding it currently is that the number of warnings should be roughly equal to the number of unique towers it connects to.  Sitting in the same spot (at my pc), one sim card found 172 in about 30 seconds while the other found only 1.  Am I misunderstanding how the warnings relate to tower count?  It seems odd to me the behavior is so different between two sim cards unless there is an issue with one of them.\r\n\r\nThanks for the quick responses btw",
